This version of pico11 is patched to work on DEMOS (Soviet UNIX):

- K&R C functions declarations
- no unsigned char
- added compat.c with backported functions

Then, it gets compiled and works on DEMOS.
Added Serge Vakulenko's patches to negotiate refresh with each keypress,
ported from here:
https://github.com/besm6/v7besm/tree/main/cmd/novi

But no Cyrillic support (yet).

pico11 is renamed to 'novi' by its author, Dave Plumber:
https://github.com/davepl/pdpsrc/tree/main/bsd/novi

but this version keeps the name because I got it when it was pico11.

